            "notes": "# Round Two\nCongrats, you made it by sitting on people's faces! \ud83e\udd73\ud83e\udd73\ud83e\udd73\n## Last game won:\nIf you won your last game, proceed with these survival items primarily [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) and [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016). Otherwise you can also get  [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) and or  [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214).\n## Note: If you are playing against a  [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0) remove  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) and replace it with  [Plot Armor](item_d1427316-79d1-43a7-a608-67beb1595131)\nWhen playing against Zarya, you're mostly going to retain  [Refraction Armor](item_dd020802-8d00-489d-93e0-930b80e31144) and [Plot Armor](item_d1427316-79d1-43a7-a608-67beb1595131).\n\n## Last game lost:\nIf you Womped your last game and have not made enough money, prioritize  [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) or [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) . If your money doesn't allow it, get  [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) and or  [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214) . If you WOMPED so hard, get  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) . With  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) prioritize using ur ult ASAP, after use of ult you gain 25 Armour and 10% Ability Power.\n\n# FYI\nFor most of the following rounds, you will retain  [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) and  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016)",
