            "notes": "# Round 3\nYay, you made it!\n\nNext Power you should obtain is  [Ignition Burst](item_52bbc55a-2003-424a-99a0-a53e4941ec58). This works great for that extra DOT (Damage over time). Also a great power to use if you're up against a  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49).\n## Last round won:\nDuring this round, the main items you have should be  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6),  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da),  [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d), and  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016).\nYou would also want to get the [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c). This item will help you stay alive the most because you will constantly be using the **Boosters** ability D.VA has, restoring your armor and shields. If you have excess cash, buy as many shield or armour items as you can.\n\n## Last round lost:\nThe main items you should be getting are [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6),  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da),  [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d), and  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016).\nIf you still have money, buy  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295).\n\n## FYI:\nDepending on your situation, consider buying  [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214) for enemies with ability power focus or  [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) for weapon power focus. \n\nAlso don't sleep on [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) 100 HP gets converted to Shields thast 25+25+25+25+ The additional 25 the item gives already! Thats like 2 epic tier items + a rare",
